Package: kmod-wireguard
Version: 5.15.173-1
Depends: kernel (=5.15.173-1-99f2be6eade494334da433e17efc3a89), kmod-crypto-lib-chacha20poly1305, kmod-crypto-lib-curve25519, kmod-udptunnel4, kmod-udptunnel6
